cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "FCPS: Multimodal Financial Crisis & Stock-Direction Prediction System"
abstract: >
  A multimodal pipeline for financial-market crisis detection and
  stock-direction detection, fusing price regimes (HMM), conditional volatility
  (GARCH), macro stress (FRED), and news sentiment (FinBERT), with SHAP
  explainability. Distinguished by an honest, leakage-free, walk-forward
  evaluation harness (exogenous forward-drawdown labels, causal filtered
  regime posteriors, purged/embargoed expanding-window backtests, calibrated
  probabilities, and deflated Sharpe / PBO gating) that reports the
  in-sample / out-of-sample gap instead of hiding it.
